WEBVTT

00:00:18.485 --> 00:00:22.965
These days, no matter what I'm doing

00:00:22.989 --> 00:00:27.358
His face keeps popping up

00:00:29.629 --> 00:00:34.110
Twenty-four hours is chock-full of time

00:00:34.134 --> 00:00:39.163
But he's tied it all up

00:00:40.473 --> 00:00:45.138
Now, I'm gonna start working

00:00:45.512 --> 00:00:51.178
But he always gets in my way

00:00:51.584 --> 00:00:56.283
I'm a really, really, really, really hard worker

00:00:56.689 --> 00:01:01.855
But I was already under his spell

00:01:02.796 --> 00:01:07.143
No matter what I'm doing, I can't help
but think about him

00:01:07.167 --> 00:01:12.333
And my mind is filled with him

00:01:13.406 --> 00:01:19.422
| just can't do anything now
unless he's there for me

00:01:19.446 --> 00:01:26.318
He's always there inside me,
me, me, me, me, me, me

00:01:35.628 --> 00:01:37.239
Okay, we'll start shooting now.

00:01:37.263 --> 00:01:38.822
I'm counting on you, Asou.

00:01:39.466 --> 00:01:41.867
I like that look of ennui.

00:01:43.236 --> 00:01:46.069
Okay! Okay! Let's keep going just like that!

00:01:47.841 --> 00:01:49.718
Asou, you look great!

00:01:49.742 --> 00:01:52.555
Man, what a surprise!

00:01:52.579 --> 00:01:55.558
| didn't know you could pull off
this kind of style.

00:01:55.582 --> 00:02:00.179
Super high school student,
Yuya Asou, breaking new ground?

00:02:02.522 --> 00:02:04.217
New ground...

00:02:04.424 --> 00:02:05.267
<i>Crossing Shibuya 9 Fun-Fun — Grand Prix</i>

00:02:05.291 --> 00:02:09.371
<i>Crossing Shibuya 9 Fun-Fun — Grand Prix
"Crossing Shibuya - Fun-Fun - Grand Prix*</i>

