00:03:20.700 --> 00:03:22.678
What? Am I free? Yeah, really free! Totally free!

00:03:22.702 --> 00:03:25.748
What? Bowling? Okay, okay, you can
count on me! I'll come flying!

00:03:25.772 --> 00:03:28.150
