00:03:52.332 --> 00:03:55.324
No, normally, it's more natural that he's here.

00:03:56.035 --> 00:03:57.179
Ook?

00:03:57.203 --> 00:03:59.548
All right, looks like all
six of us are here!

00:03:59.572 --> 00:04:02.518
So, let's pick pairs by drawing lots!

00:04:02.542 --> 00:04:05.443
What? Pairs? In other words,
two people make up one group.

00:04:05.912 --> 00:04:06.755
