00:04:30.570 --> 00:04:34.483
Let's see, the "Model Students
with Good Grades" Team!

00:04:34.507 --> 00:04:36.218
What a haphazard name.

00:04:36.242 --> 00:04:38.053
Good luck to us both.

00:04:38.077 --> 00:04:39.788
Oh, sure.

00:04:39.812 --> 00:04:41.890
Following right along,
these are the last two!

00:04:41.914 --> 00:04:42.725
Well...

00:04:42.749 --> 00:04:45.294
