00:04:45.318 --> 00:04:49.498
No fair! It's just not fair! How mean
can the god of fate be?!

00:04:49.522 --> 00:04:52.334
Oh? You're not happy with Miyu
as your partner?

00:04:52.358 --> 00:04:55.237
Oh no, no way. That's not
what I meant, but...

00:04:55.261 --> 00:04:58.307
Now, as usual, for the team
coming in last place,

00:04:58.331 --> 00:05:01.028
