00:05:25.224 --> 00:05:26.502
Too bad!

00:05:26.526 --> 00:05:30.306
Don't worry, don't worry!
Leave the rest to me, my girl!

00:05:30.330 --> 00:05:31.473
Love and power!

00:05:31.497 --> 00:05:33.976
