the power of love!

00:05:34.000 --> 00:05:36.178
Tatsukichi, good luck!

00:05:36.202 --> 00:05:37.146
Yes, Sir!

00:05:37.170 --> 00:05:39.264
Let's monkey!

00:05:43.209 --> 00:05:44.920
Oh, mistake.

00:05:44.944 --> 00:05:48.457
In Japanese, that would be,
"Even monkeys fall from trees."

00:05:48.481 --> 00:05:49.525
That is so uncool!

00:05:49.549 --> 00:05:52.995
Hey, play seriously, Tatsukichi!
What're you gonna do if we lose?!

00:05:53.019 --> 00:05:54.630
