00:05:54.654 --> 00:05:58.100
Now, next up is the Leftovers Team!

00:05:58.124 --> 00:05:59.935
Second Place, hit it big!

00:05:59.959 --> 00:06:01.303
Second Place, fight!

00:06:01.327 --> 00:06:03.091
