have gathered in the hopes

00:12:20.806 --> 00:12:24.052
of becoming the boyfriend of Shibuya's
number one gal, Ran Kotobuki!

00:12:24.076 --> 00:12:27.389
And now, we have an opening
greeting from the producer,

00:12:27.413 --> 00:12:31.993
and in a sense, the prize of
this race, Ran Kotobuki!

00:12:32.017 --> 00:12:34.577
Everyone, please welcome her with
a warm round of applause!

00:12:40.993 --> 00:12:42.825
You guys...

00:12:43.429 --> 00:12:45.659
You wanna be my boyfriend?!

00:12:47.700 --> 00:12:51.012
The guy who becomes my boyfriend
super-obviously needs to be GL!

00:12:51.036 --> 00:12:53.882
He must be super-excellent in
everything there is

00:12:53.906 --> 00:12:55.884
including strength, of course,
and intelligence and spirit!

00:12:55.908 --> 00:12:57.285
First place! Number one!

00:12:57.309 --> 00:13:01.177
Only the winner who grabs the top
spot himself can become my boyfriend!

00:13:02.381 --> 00:13:04.326
You wanna be my boyfriend?!

00:13:04.350 --> 00:13:06.361
Are you afraid of penalty games?!

00:13:06.385 --> 00:13:08.196
Did you do your homework?!

00:13:08.220 --> 00:13:10.599
A-B-C-D?!

00:13:10.623 --> 00:13:12.934
Now, it's almost the start time.

00:13:12.958 --> 00:13:15.484
Everyone, take your places!

00:13:17.062 --> 00:13:18.757
Ready!

00:13:19.899 --> 00:13:21.424
Woo-hoo!

00:13:21.700 --> 00:13:23.745
Hey, Second Place, not bad!

00:13:23.769 --> 00:13:25.447
How?

00:13:25.471 --> 00:13:27.906
How did this end up being
such a huge mess?

00:13:31.343 --> 00:13:33.555
Why? Second Place, why are you crying?

00:13:33.579 --> 00:13:36.691
Shut up! When you get right down
to it, this is ALL your fault!

00:13:36.715 --> 00:13:38.794
| am not gonna lose this fight!

00:13:38.818 --> 00:13:40.786
All right! I'm not gonna lose either!

00:13:45.825 --> 00:13:48.170
So, Tatsukichi and Second Place
are in the lead after all.

00:13:48.194 --> 00:13:49.771
Good, good.

00:13:49.795 --> 00:13:51.439
Hey, hey, Ran.

00:13:51.463 --> 00:13:53.488
How far are they supposed to run?

00:13:53.833 --> 00:13:55.677
Oh, well, that.

00:13:55.701 --> 00:13:58.295
They'll keep running until the
numbers go down a good bit.

00:14:01.674 --> 00:14:04.473
| can't go on. I don't
normally exercise.

00:14:05.377 --> 00:14:08.356
Guys are dropping out in droves
at the intensely high pace.

00:14:08.380 --> 00:14:12.283
The battle is already taking on the
characteristics of a survival race!

00:14:13.886 --> 00:14:14.896
Checkpoint 2

00:14:14.920 --> 00:14:15.063
Success

00:14:15.087 --> 00:14:17.799
Success What are we going
to do in this place? What?

00:14:17.823 --> 00:14:17.982
Success

00:14:18.691 --> 00:14:23.185
Why... aren't you... tired?
You... endurance... freak!

00:14:24.029 --> 00:14:25.724
Here you go.

00:14:25.998 --> 00:14:27.108
Aya!

00:14:27.132 --> 00:14:29.678
Next up is an intelligence test. Good luck.

00:14:29.702 --> 00:14:31.079
Intelligence test?

00:14:31.103 --> 00:14:34.950
All right, it's time to show off the abilities
of the prestigious Meisho 1 High School!

00:14:34.974 --> 00:14:37.586
I'll put some distance between
Tatsukichi and me with this!

00:14:37.610 --> 00:14:40.822
You can advance as soon as you get
eighty points or more.

00:14:40.846 --> 00:14:42.424
Good luck, everyone.

00:14:42.448 --> 00:14:43.347
MOIHD FONIDITIALNI

00:14:45.484 --> 00:14:48.044
Hey, it's a bubble sheet test.

00:14:49.688 --> 00:14:50.465
Ook!

00:14:50.489 --> 00:14:53.735
Aya, if you advance as soon as you
get more than eighty points,

00:14:53.759 --> 00:14:55.237
does that mean you can try
as many times as you want?

00:14:55.261 --> 00:14:58.039
Well, it isn't against the rules...

00:14:58.063 --> 00:14:59.007
Ook!

00:14:59.031 --> 00:15:00.842
Okay!

00:15:00.866 --> 00:15:02.143
Thirty points.

00:15:02.167 --> 00:15:03.612
Ook!

00:15:03.636 --> 00:15:04.779
Fifty points.

00:15:04.803 --> 00:15:06.248
Ook ook!

00:15:06.272 --> 00:15:07.349
Twenty points.

00:15:07.373 --> 00:15:08.717
Ook ook ook!

00:15:08.741 --> 00:15:10.952
Oh, eighty points. You pass.

00:15:10.976 --> 00:15:12.721
Ook!

00:15:12.745 --> 00:15:14.189
Ook ook ook! Ook ook ook!

00:15:14.213 --> 00:15:15.590
Aya, here you go!

00:15:15.614 --> 00:15:17.859
Okay, let's see...

00:15:17.883 --> 00:15:19.594
One hundred points. You pass.

00:15:19.618 --> 00:15:20.929
All right!

00:15:20.953 --> 00:15:22.998
Tatsukichi can sit there
and struggle all he wants!

00:15:23.022 --> 00:15:25.867
But he went ahead already.

00:15:25.891 --> 00:15:27.757
What?! For real?!

00:15:30.195 --> 00:15:31.139
Checkpoint 3

00:15:31.163 --> 00:15:31.206
Checkpoint 3
Para-para dance contest!

00:15:31.230 --> 00:15:33.909
Para-para dance contest!

00:15:33.933 --> 00:15:35.343
Yeah!

00:15:35.367 --> 00:15:38.380
At this checkpoint, we'll use the
para-para scoring machine

00:15:38.404 --> 00:15:40.382
to check out your sense
of style in dancing!

00:15:40.406 --> 00:15:42.050
First dancer up is...

00:15:42.074 --> 00:15:44.452
The para-para king of Machida,
Tatsuki Kuroi!

00:15:44.476 --> 00:15:45.787
And don't you forget it!

00:15:45.811 --> 00:15:47.575
Music start!

00:15:54.320 --> 00:15:56.631
Bravo! You pass! No complaints here!

00:15:56.655 --> 00:15:58.166
Next up...

00:15:58.190 --> 00:16:00.936
Number two, Yuya Asoul!
Watch closely, Tatsukichi!

00:16:00.960 --> 00:16:02.655
Music start!

00:16:09.335 --> 00:16:10.545
Good going, Second Place!

00:16:10.569 --> 00:16:12.681
| had no idea you were good at para.

00:16:12.705 --> 00:16:13.682
As if!

00:16:13.706 --> 00:16:14.816
What?

00:16:14.840 --> 00:16:16.418
That's payback for the bowling.

00:16:16.442 --> 00:16:19.354
| just aped the dance that you did!
So take that!

00:16:19.378 --> 00:16:21.623
For real? That's even more amazing!

00:16:21.647 --> 00:16:23.925
It won't be long before you're the
para-para king of Shibuya!

00:16:23.949 --> 00:16:25.860
| don't give a damn about that!

00:16:25.884 --> 00:16:25.961
Say, Aya?

00:16:25.985 --> 00:16:27.228
Next dancer, please!
Say, Aya?

00:16:27.252 --> 00:16:28.229
Next dancer, please!

00:16:28.253 --> 00:16:28.797
What's she going to do if a stranger wins?

00:16:28.821 --> 00:16:31.032
Racer 49, lkeda, will now dance!
What's she going to do if a stranger wins?

00:16:31.056 --> 00:16:31.933
Music start!
What's she going to do if a stranger wins?

00:16:31.957 --> 00:16:32.934
Music start!
| don't know.

00:16:32.958 --> 00:16:35.188
Checkpoint three is over!

00:16:35.594 --> 00:16:38.188
All right, let's keep going!
Don't fall behind, you guys!

00:16:39.765 --> 00:16:43.712
If your girlfriend is about to get hit by a car,
throw yourself in there and save her!

00:16:43.736 --> 00:16:45.246
That's a qualification for
being my boyfriend!

00:16:45.270 --> 00:16:47.315
Reflex contest! If there's a fire, get
to her even before the firemen do!

00:16:47.339 --> 00:16:48.616
That's a qualification for
being my boyfriend!

00:16:48.640 --> 00:16:49.651
For that, you need sprinting power!

00:16:49.675 --> 00:16:51.252
Nothing says sprinting power
like climbing stairs!

00:16:51.276 --> 00:16:53.221
Ramen is one of my favorite foods!

00:16:53.245 --> 00:16:54.789
You love everything that
your girlfriend does!

00:16:54.813 --> 00:16:56.091
That's a qualification for
being my boyfriend!

00:16:56.115 --> 00:16:57.241
Eat fast and eat lots!

00:16:57.649 --> 00:16:59.461
You have to humor her willfulness and
go along with her every whim!

00:16:59.485 --> 00:17:00.795
That's a qualification for
being my boyfriend!

00:17:00.819 --> 00:17:01.663
For that, you need perseverance!

00:17:01.687 --> 00:17:03.280
Nothing says perseverance
like moxibustion!

00:17:04.790 --> 00:17:06.280
All right, let's go onto the next one!

00:17:07.026 --> 00:17:08.050
Monster...

00:17:09.795 --> 00:17:12.007
Now, the race is finally drawing
to a conclusion!

00:17:12.031 --> 00:17:14.109
The final test is...

00:17:14.133 --> 00:17:15.043
Right over here!

00:17:15.067 --> 00:17:17.399
Free climbing contest!

00:17:17.936 --> 00:17:21.383
And over here are the four brave
souls who will attempt this wall!

00:17:21.407 --> 00:17:23.218
Racer 1, Kuroi!

00:17:23.242 --> 00:17:25.186
Racer 2, Asou!

00:17:25.210 --> 00:17:27.188
Racer 49, |keda!

00:17:27.212 --> 00:17:29.190
Racer 50, Fukuroda!

00:17:29.214 --> 00:17:31.426
Come tears, come laughter, this is the end!

00:17:31.450 --> 00:17:34.283
The grand finale of fate! Ready!

00:17:35.487 --> 00:17:37.832
Tatsukichi! Second Place! Go for it!

00:17:37.856 --> 00:17:39.984
Second Place! I'm secretly rooting for you!

00:17:42.828 --> 00:17:46.162
Ikeda and Fukuroda made it through
like they were supposed to.

00:17:46.932 --> 00:17:48.877
Mami, when are you going
to spring the trap?

00:17:48.901 --> 00:17:50.879
Spring the trap? What are you
talking about?

00:17:50.903 --> 00:17:54.601
Aren't you going to use those two
to ruin this event?

00:17:56.141 --> 00:17:58.119
| ain't gonna do that.

00:17:58.143 --> 00:18:00.355
What do you mean?

00:18:00.379 --> 00:18:03.076
I'm going to have those two win.

00:18:03.916 --> 00:18:05.315
And then...

00:18:05.951 --> 00:18:09.631
All right! I'll make you my boyfriend,
just like I promised.

00:18:09.655 --> 00:18:11.299
Oh, you know, I changed my mind.

00:18:11.323 --> 00:18:13.268
What?! Why?!

00:18:13.292 --> 00:18:15.056
Oh, what a beautiful lady!

00:18:15.394 --> 00:18:19.107
You are far more bewitching than
Ran Kotobuki of Shibuya!

00:18:19.131 --> 00:18:21.566
My, my, what a troublesome boy.

00:18:21.900 --> 00:18:22.710
Something like that!

00:18:22.734 --> 00:18:22.877
If you have your heart set on doing it that way,
Something like that!

00:18:22.901 --> 00:18:25.013
If you have your heart set on doing it that way,

00:18:25.037 --> 00:18:25.547
If you have your heart set on doing it that way,
How do you like that, Kotobuki?!

00:18:25.571 --> 00:18:26.781
| won't stop you, but...
How do you like that, Kotobuki?!

00:18:26.805 --> 00:18:28.204
| won't stop you, but...

00:18:28.474 --> 00:18:30.718
Now, they're only a short
distance from the top!

00:18:30.742 --> 00:18:33.822
What kind of drama could
possibly be awaiting them?!

00:18:33.846 --> 00:18:34.689
Fukuroda Ilkeda Second Place Tatsukichi What
kind of drama could possibly be awaiting them™?!

00:18:34.713 --> 00:18:35.202
Fukuroda Ilkeda
Second Place Tatsukichi

00:18:35.581 --> 00:18:38.516
Damn it, they just keep
getting in my way!

00:18:45.524 --> 00:18:46.434
Tatsukichi!

00:18:46.458 --> 00:18:47.168
What?

00:18:47.192 --> 00:18:50.253
Be careful! Those guys up there are
planting something into the holds!

00:18:57.903 --> 00:18:59.447
A tack!

00:18:59.471 --> 00:19:02.736
Hey, you! Dirty tricks like this are
no thank you in my book!

00:19:03.342 --> 00:19:05.286
Well, don't hold it against us.

00:19:05.310 --> 00:19:06.421
What?

00:19:06.445 --> 00:19:08.777
We've got our own reasons
for what we're doing.

00:19:09.414 --> 00:19:10.925
Now...

00:19:10.949 --> 00:19:12.994
Fukuroda, you're getting too far ahead!

00:19:13.018 --> 00:19:15.419
Your role is to interfere with
their progress, remember?!

00:19:16.221 --> 00:19:18.622
Sorry, lkeda. Forgive me!

00:19:19.992 --> 00:19:20.959
| also...

00:19:21.293 --> 00:19:23.261
| also...

00:19:23.896 --> 00:19:26.957
| also want to become Ran's boyfriend!

00:19:27.166 --> 00:19:30.145
Hey, you moron! Miss Mami's going
to beat the crap out of you!

00:19:30.169 --> 00:19:31.967
And that's what I don't want!

00:19:32.371 --> 00:19:35.917
| don't wanna slave away under
Miss Mami anymore!

00:19:35.941 --> 00:19:36.985
You moron!

00:19:37.009 --> 00:19:38.738
Ikeda!

00:19:39.745 --> 00:19:40.955
If that's what we're talking about,

00:19:40.979 --> 00:19:43.258
| like Ran more than Miss Mami too!

00:19:43.282 --> 00:19:46.161
| don't wanna go back to Bukuro
and that psycho bitch either!

00:19:46.185 --> 00:19:46.961
Hey, falll

00:19:46.985 --> 00:19:49.030
What the hell?! YOU fall!

00:19:49.054 --> 00:19:52.080
Fall! Fall! Fall! Fall! Fall!

00:19:55.794 --> 00:19:58.006
Goodness! Two have now
dropped out of the race!

00:19:58.030 --> 00:19:59.841
They were saying all sorts of things...

00:19:59.865 --> 00:20:00.975
So that's how it is.

00:20:00.999 --> 00:20:04.264
I'll make sure you can't walk back
to Bukuro just like you wanted.

00:20:05.070 --> 00:20:08.850
Hey, Second Place, are you okay?
They got your finger, right?

00:20:08.874 --> 00:20:10.185
Shut up.

00:20:10.209 --> 00:20:10.919
What?

00:20:10.943 --> 00:20:13.421
| told you that my fight with you
was dead serious.

00:20:13.445 --> 00:20:15.323
Quit being weirdly compassionate!

00:20:15.347 --> 00:20:17.025
Hey, no fair!

00:20:17.049 --> 00:20:18.660
Both of you, hang in there!

00:20:18.684 --> 00:20:20.652
Fight!

00:20:40.005 --> 00:20:42.083
Hey, what the heck are
you guys doing?!

00:20:42.107 --> 00:20:43.651
Can't you tell just by looking?

00:20:43.675 --> 00:20:45.987
It's dangerous, so hurry up
and get down here!

00:20:46.011 --> 00:20:47.522
Hey, policeman!

00:20:47.546 --> 00:20:50.058
Shoot, that's Ran's older brother.

00:20:50.082 --> 00:20:51.793
For real?!

00:20:51.817 --> 00:20:53.161
Hey, what's wrong, Second Place?

00:20:53.185 --> 00:20:55.196
| just remembered...

00:20:55.220 --> 00:20:57.689
I'm acrophobic.

00:20:58.490 --> 00:21:00.501
What? Hey, you okay?

00:21:00.525 --> 00:21:02.152
| told you not to touch.

00:21:15.540 --> 00:21:18.339
| guess the result of the race
ended up being unclear.

00:21:19.111 --> 00:21:20.955
Say, Ran?

00:21:20.979 --> 00:21:24.792
What were you going to do
if a stranger won?

00:21:24.816 --> 00:21:26.961
| don't lie.

00:21:26.985 --> 00:21:28.563
| would have made him my boyfriend.

00:21:28.587 --> 00:21:30.164
No way!

00:21:30.188 --> 00:21:34.068
But whether he would still be
my boyfriend the next day

00:21:34.092 --> 00:21:36.104
would have depended on the guy.

00:21:36.128 --> 00:21:38.529
What's up with that?

00:21:39.731 --> 00:21:41.843
Hey, brother, good work.

00:21:41.867 --> 00:21:45.046
Hey, it's not like I've
acknowledged you, okay?

00:21:45.070 --> 00:21:47.982
Oh, no, let's be friends, brother.

00:21:48.006 --> 00:21:49.684
| ain't your brother!

00:21:49.708 --> 00:21:51.252
Second Place...

00:21:51.276 --> 00:21:53.745
You're a really nice guy.

00:21:54.012 --> 00:21:57.659
You worried about if Tatsukichi was
worthy of being my boyfriend,

00:21:57.683 --> 00:21:59.527
even when you're acrophobic!

00:21:59.551 --> 00:22:03.954
You really are the nicest guy!
Thanks, Second Place!

00:22:05.090 --> 00:22:06.990
Ran...

00:22:09.227 --> 00:22:11.639
Good, good!

00:22:11.663 --> 00:22:14.709
You look alive today for some reason.

00:22:14.733 --> 00:22:16.701
Okay, okay.

00:22:17.703 --> 00:22:19.914
Very, very good.

00:22:19.938 --> 00:22:22.350
The look of ennui from before was good too,

00:22:22.374 --> 00:22:26.487
but you look best when you have
a refreshing smile on your face.

00:22:26.511 --> 00:22:28.690
You think so?

00:22:28.714 --> 00:22:30.682
Thank you very much.

00:22:31.116 --> 00:22:33.161
Well, shall we get a little more work done?

00:22:33.185 --> 00:22:34.846
Yes, Sir!

00:22:35.887 --> 00:22:41.903
| hate it, you're always laughing

00:22:41.927 --> 00:22:48.094
And so strong and cute and popular

00:22:48.533 --> 00:22:54.882
| hate it, I'm so dull and slow

00:22:54.906 --> 00:23:00.174
And no one needs me...

00:23:01.146 --> 00:23:07.428
You're smart and always so perfect

00:23:07.452 --> 00:23:13.221
People probably just make fun of me

00:23:13.792 --> 00:23:20.108
To be honest, I want to try talking to you

00:23:20.132 --> 00:23:25.813
| want to become friends with you

00:23:25.837 --> 00:23:31.799
| was so envious of you

00:23:32.177 --> 00:23:37.759
And my shoulders would tremble as I cried alone

00:23:37.783 --> 00:23:45.299
Tell me, are you alone and afraid, too?

00:23:45.323 --> 00:23:51.239
Is everyone miserable and weak?

00:23:51.263 --> 00:23:57.945
If only I had more courage

00:23:57.969 --> 00:24:04.375
| would have given you a hug

00:24:05.343 --> 00:24:06.421
Next Super GALS!

00:24:06.445 --> 00:24:08.756
Next Super GALS! Beat from supplementary
classes, dizzy headed, studying is a pain,

00:24:08.780 --> 00:24:09.023
Next Super GALS!
and Shiori's all about kendo.

00:24:09.047 --> 00:24:09.857
And Shiori's all about kendo.

00:24:09.881 --> 00:24:12.693
My fellow supplementary class sufferer,
Shiori Asai is kendo all the way.

00:24:12.717 --> 00:24:16.063
Her ability is first rate and her dream is first
place at the high school national competition!

00:24:16.087 --> 00:24:19.100
For Shiori, the next tournament
is her fateful last chance!

00:24:19.124 --> 00:24:22.437
I'll keep my promise with you too,
so make sure you win this thing!

00:24:22.461 --> 00:24:24.372
All right! Part, part time job, part time job!

00:24:24.396 --> 00:24:26.674
Guess I'll step up and help out
for the sake of a friend!

00:24:26.698 --> 00:24:26.774
Next time on Super Gals Ran Kotobuki,

